WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.320
Gramps?

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:40.740
I declare a death sentence on all mankind.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:45.580
In 27 minutes and 53 seconds, ARK will crash into Earth.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:50.540
You and Earth will die together.

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:59.860
Episode 38

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:59.860
Maria's Request, Everyone's Request

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.890
Aww, you were worried about me?

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:08.440
The way our transmission was cut off, of course I was!

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.160
It's about time I finish this!

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.290
Got it!

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:43.140
Too bad. Now it's all over!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.640
We'll see about that.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.940
Maria, it's time!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.650
Hey!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.040
What's happening?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.920
The Chaos Emeralds!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:16.380
I declare a death sentence on all mankind.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:21.260
In 27 minutes and 53 seconds, ARK will crash into Earth.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:25.600
You and Earth will die together.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:34.310
When the seven Chaos Emeralds are gathered together, my plan for revenge begins.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.070
This program is irreversible.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:40.400
You stupid humans took everything away from me.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:44.030
I'll make you feel the same despair that I felt.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.490
Do you have anything left to say?

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.410
No.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.080
Aim!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.380
What is this? Who is that?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.840
Professor Gerald Robotnik.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.470
My grandfather was known as the smartest scientist of the century.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.550
I declare a death sentence on all mankind.

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:08.510
The tremors are getting worse.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.140
It's over for us.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.810
I just received a transmission from Earth.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:19.320
This colony is heading towards Earth at tremendous speed.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:23.490
At this rate, we'll crash into Earth.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:33.290
Gramps, you mad scientist... You sure did it...

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.370
Tell me what's going on.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.460
Sonic!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.920
You're one tough hedgehog.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.050
You're still alive.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:46.680
Riding in a shuttle with Knuckles was much scarier than him.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:55.310
I found my grandfather's diary in Prison Island's data bank.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:05:01.230
I don't understand why things turned out this way.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:06.780
Was it a mistake to try and create the ultimate life form?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:13.000
They're afraid that they won't be able to control the ultimate life form.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:19.710
I hope my lab colleagues and my beloved grandchild Maria are safe.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:25.300
They reported that ARK was shut down due to an accident.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:29.350
I found Maria's name in the list of victims.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.640
I've lost everything.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:40.020
I no longer have anything. I can't think of anything... except revenge. It scares me.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:43.030
What's going through my mind?

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.900
Somebody stop me!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:56.580
Based on the original data, I've finally created Shadow.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.210
I completely control his memory.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.380
I leave everything to Shadow.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:05.920
Awaken him if you yearn for power.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:08.760
If you yearn for despair to take over the world.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:15.720
This program is irreversible.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.390
What's going on?

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:22.110
We've received emergency messages from the Space Bureau and Military Headquarters.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:25.860
Space Colony ARK is plummeting towards Earth with tremendous energy.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:31.160
At this rate, the impact on Earth will be the same or greater than when it blasted the moon.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:35.080
No way! That will kill everyone on Earth!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:43.420
Will this be the end, Sonic?

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.010
Freeze!

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:57.430
You're under arrest for attempted murder and treason.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:02.940
GUN formed a secret organization to erase all traces of Project Shadow.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:08.240
They even kept their existence hidden from the President.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.030
Even though we've arrested them...

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:23.000
Energized by the Chaos Emeralds, the Eclipse Cannon has turned into a giant bomb.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.840
If we crash, Earth will no longer exist!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:31.220
The colony's propulsive force is also due to the Chaos Emeralds.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:34.300
First, we have to stop the out-of-control Chaos Emeralds.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:35.680
I know!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:39.930
Me?

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:43.400
Don't be silly. Not you. Your gem!

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.360
The Master Emerald!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.400
It might work.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.950
We all have to work together.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:54.950
Let's figure out the shortest route to the Chaos Emeralds.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:58.910
Leave it to me. When it comes to running, I'm faster than anyone!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.460
Okay, let's start the plan!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.920
I'm detecting that the Chaos Emeralds are at the innermost part of the ARK.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.380
Hurry!

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.090
Take that!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.170
Everyone, hang in there.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.460
Is waiting the only thing we can do?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.260
Let's believe in their strength.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.180
It's pointless.

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.810
Shadow!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.300
Chris…

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:42.470
Shadow, please save them.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:50.940
I don't believe that they created you to become a tool for revenge.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:55.320
Because you saved me before.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:01.990
I know that deep in your heart, you don't want anyone to die!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:03.660
Let me go.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.580
Chris!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.710
Tanaka?

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:22.640
All I'm going to do is carry out Maria's wish.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:26.890
Maria doesn't want revenge.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.770
What?

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:33.230
No one wants their friend to do something horrible.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:37.900
Live for revenge and then die afterwards?

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.660
That's not right!

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:40.820
Shut up!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:47.160
There's nothing in this world worth saving!

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:54.250
They took Maria away from me.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:11:00.050
Maria wasn't allowed to leave because her body was weak since birth.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:05.390
I want to get better as soon as possible so that I could go down to that planet.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:09.350
And I want to make many friends that are like you, Shadow.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:20.240
But guess what you humans did!

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:26.330
In order to protect your pathetic happiness...

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.380
You're right.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:41.510
There's fighting everyday on Earth.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:47.100
Everyone may be selfish, self-centered and foolish.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.310
But they're all living!

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:55.560
They're doing their best to live so that they can all live together in happiness someday.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.940
Don't take that future away from them.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:03.820
Please give them a chance.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.330
Please, Shadow.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:17.630
Someday, as my replacement...

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:20.420
Maria!

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:25.010
For everyone living on that planet...

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:29.680
Please give them a chance to attain happiness.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:35.150
Please grant everyone's wish.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:39.520
That's what you were born to do.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:53.620
You're like a shadow that always watches over us.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.350
Shadow…

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:21.020
Right, Maria. That's what you were actually hoping for.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.460
That must be it!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:45.920
It's huge!

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:50.350
This must be the ultimate life form prototype that they sealed away!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.180
Let me take care of it.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.060
Shadow!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:00.270
Secure the Chaos Emeralds while I distract it!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:13.490
Let's go!

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:14.450
What's going on?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.430
Vanish, you ugly sample!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.480
What must be done. The seven chaos.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:40.600
Chaos is power.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.270
Power comes from the heart.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.240
The one who masters that also controls chaos.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.400
Calm down, Knuckles!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:54.990
Master Emerald, please stop the Chaos Emeralds!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.400
We did it!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.940
Hooray!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.080
It vanished.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.990
It's Chaos Control.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.160
What's happening?

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.460
Why won't it stop?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.580
Can you hear me, Sonic?

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.710
The prototype is still alive!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:52.090
It's fusing with this colony to crash into the Earth together!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.290
Sonic?

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.970
Let's attack from both sides!

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:39.890
Okay!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:42.520
You monster, it's over!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.940
The colony is still falling towards Earth.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.820
In a few minutes, it will enter the point of no return.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.530
What's that?

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:05.670
We've detected two hedgehogs underneath the colony.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:08.380
They're entering the atmosphere.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.420
It's Sonic. There's no doubt about it!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:15.180
It's absurd! What can two hedgehogs do at a time like this?

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:19.760
Sonic…

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:27.810
I know that they'll succeed. I believe in them.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:31.530
Sonic… Shadow…

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.360
Topaz, can you hear me?

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.910
I can hear you! It's Sonic, right?

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.990
We can see him too!

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:44.870
That red star is the result of a crime that the government covered up 50 years ago.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:49.710
Our generation must take the responsibility.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:55.090
Because looking away from the truth is also a crime.

00:17:55.630 --> 00:18:00.930
However, they're fighting on our behalf despite our sins!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:02.850
Sonic...

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:08.350
Don't give up!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.330
I won't let you go any farther!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.420
Hang in there, Sonic!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.430
Hang in there, Shadow!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.680
We're counting on you both.

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:45.720
Don't give up!

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.980
Please do your best!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.940
Sonic! Shadow!

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.190
Shadow...

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:58.240
Please grant everyone's wish.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.490
I'm Shadow!

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:04.740
Shadow the Hedgehog!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:09.960
Can you hear me?

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.460
Yeah!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.710
I can hear you!

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.760
Chaos!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.180
Control!

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:26.410
<b>Can you feel life movin' through your mind</b>

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:30.290
<b>Looks like it came back for more!</b>

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:38.070
<b>When you can't help but follow</b>

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:40.780
Maria, is this what you wanted?

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:42.880
<b>It puts you right back where you came. </b>

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.930
<b>Live and learn!</b>

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:50.330
They did it!

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:50.430
<b>Hanging on the edge of tomorrow</b>

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:52.270
<b>Live and learn!</b>

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:57.340
Thank you, Sonic!

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:56.120
<b>From the works of yesterday</b>

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:58.260
<b>Live and learn!</b>

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.720
We have a message from the Space Bureau.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:01.710
<b>If you beg or if you borrow</b>

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:04.180
The colony is currently stopped at position L1.

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:03.400
<b>Live and learn!</b>

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:10.010
<b>You may never find your way!</b>

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.720
He's a hero.

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:11.140
Now that we're adults, we could never have accomplished such a feat.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.850
No, it's never too late.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.870
<b>Live and learn!</b>

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:18.440
As long as we never give up, just like them.

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.330
<b>Live and learn!</b>

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.820
Isn't that right?

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.120
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.870
<b></b>

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:33.040
When I was little, Gramps was my hero.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:37.840
I dreamed of becoming a scientist, just like him.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:42.800
I wonder if Gramps really meant to kill us.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:47.850
I don't know, but we accomplished what we had to do.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.010
That's true.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:52.100
But next time, I'm going to accomplish what I have to do.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.810
I'm going to conquer the world!

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:56.230
You're still not giving up?

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.690
Of course not!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.770
Next time we meet, we're showing no mercy!

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:01.360
Same here!

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.870
Sonic!

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.670
Where's Shadow?

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:35.640
Was Gerald's creation really a tool for revenge?

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.440
He was who he was.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:41.610
He was a hedgehog who sacrificed his life to protect the planet.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:47.490
He's Shadow the Hedgehog.

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.040
You're right.

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:58.630
Hey hey.

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.170
Let's go home.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:05.380
Back to the planet that's round and blue, just like me.

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:08.260
The shuttle is ready for takeoff.

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:25.240
Adios, Shadow the Hedgehog.

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.550 --> 00:25:35.360
The Chaotix Detective Agency
